WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Check in and meet the shift lead.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Read the order and find the shelf code.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Scan the item. Match the code and quantity.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Pack it, apply the label, and hand it over for dispatch.

